{
  "id": "2KI.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "2 Sugoodiga 19",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda ghoanyaashta ng'asheega aba heeda Isaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiyiiy Hesekiya was sugoocheanda ng'asheesu hean ghabwaashaada hang'weakaaschi. Ak gookwa guniyajeega, ak gawa jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeakta Eliyakimu was siida haw ambal gheanyi, ea Shebina was ng'oorshoocheanda, ea gweargwa ashoohoodiga, nea niikwa guniyajeega. Ak gaweay heeda Isaya orjeeda Amosi was sibaneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeyeesha, “Gwayi Hesekiya eaweecheanji eaweeda sawanadeeda gil, ea baspaseega, ea giing'weaka, aba gideaba nihita damanda jeata, ak ea manda uurda jea eejiila diibiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamneawa gwadeepa ghwayiiy NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ng'asheega sean bea shirikarajeandida hawiin. Ghayi ajeagu sugoocheanda Ashuru siidaanyi haw goong'eawi ASEETA majeek, ak niny gaygoowoowsa ng'asheega iiy NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. Eaniyean mwasha ASEATAANG'U ghawooda aba badayda boosteanga abit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweesa Isaya fuga gadiyeeda bea Hesekiya was sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Isaya ak gwayeesha saawa. “Ayeeshiina siideang'wa haw, gideaba ‘gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA. Adibeali aba ng'asheesu iyiinyiin ghayi ang'eawanean fuga gadiyeeda bea sugoocheanda Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula gaydayiin guroorooda muuwda jeadaanyi, ak gaygooleeysiit ng'asheega ng'uyeega ak gaygabiikta ng'eang'da nyaawa. Ak gaydabwar aba ng'uta aba ng'eanyiidaanyi.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega suuk nung' ghang'ut giyoonda fuga Ashuru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiikta shirikarajeandida hawiin, ghwahita nea gang'uchi sugoocheanda Ashuru ea Libina aba gideaba ghwayiiy gideaba sugoocheanda ninung'wa heeda Lakishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy sugoocheanda iita Dirhaka sugoocheanda Gushi, “Ng'ula ghwahidu ng'ucheewana,” hean goojeakta buuneeda heeda Hesekiya deabiyeenya nea gwayeesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Arukusiina Hesekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda ng'asheesu, gideaba ‘adagwareenganeey ASEATAANG'U ighusi nea gwayi Yerusalemu majeayiin geatinga sugoocheanda Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula niyiinyi ng'asheega sima ng'eanyiisean sugoodiga Ashuru, geanung' goosha buuneesean, heapi ang'iing'i gayghuuha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi aseecheeka eemooji ghayi nung' ghweanigeasu goosha ghweanigeasu niighuuheagwa? Was Gosani ea Harani, ea Resefu, ea fuga Edeni ghayi mida Delasari? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwanda yeenu sugoocheanda Hamati, ea sugoocheanda Arpadi, ea sugoocheanda mujiineeda Sefarfaimu, ea Hena ea Ifa?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanyas Hesekiya barawajeanda adaw fugiga siicheaguun, ak ghoasoamwa; ng'ata ghwascheang'da Hesekiya gawa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghoayaaw aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamwaash ASEETA Hesekiya aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli, hoorgeadaang'u iibiiti ghwasuut geeruubajeanda, ang'iing'i geaghusnyi guwoosi ASEETA sugoodiga sean bea badayda ng'eanyiida, ang'iing'i gibwadi humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aleaydiit Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, ak giyiinyi, jaada gheanyangaagu Ea NG'UTAMIIDA ak gidaahi ak giyiinyi ng'asheega Senakeribu, goojeagu siida ghwahidu goong'eawi ASEETA majeek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huumwa gil Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, sugoodiga Ashuru niduulu eemooji ea darooraka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gwajaksa aseecheeka nyaawa jeeda beasta, aba gideaba mii aseecheeka gil haleanjeeda sin buuneeda gil aba geatinga nyaawa. Geediga gil ea lagheanga, ak ghoah gidasinung' goosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA aghuuhaneasa geatindaanyi, geamuscheey aba gideaba ghwanal sugoodiga ng'eanyiisean gideaba ang'iing'i ak ghwahit guwoosi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giijasta Isaya weah heeda sugoocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta Isaya was orjeeda Amosi giijasta heeda Hesekiya nea gwayeesha, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli. Nimuscheani aba badayda Senakeribu was sugoocheanda Ashuru, ak eara aniini ea nealeeyseey iit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih ng'asheega rugu NG'UTAMIIDA gil aba badaydaanyi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ak nih gayghoah gwadeagooda aba headaang'u: gweanyi gajayaaga booga ridu nea gabwageat, nea eara gweaydeaba iyeenya gajayaaga gea sunu. Gweaydeaba samwagu ahista booga, ak ghoalaji, ahista madameega sabiibu ak ghoayaaji haghweagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea boosteanga ghuh bea gheeh Yuda gayghwayiin hawunga ng'eanyi ak gwaji haghweega saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba boosteanga gaygwaleabu Yerusalemu, nea gea jea ghaghu gaygwanda uhuuda giijeeda Sayuni. Ng'asheanji gaygwasin lachng'eanyiida NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Asi NG'UTAMIIDA ghwanyaashtunu aba badayda sugoocheanda Ashuru. Niny mwayghwala jeedeaba mujiineani, nea maygwajakta geacheeda aba hiji, nea mayghwahidu madeadaanyi nea gwadiiw igeambooda nea maygooneaweesa hilgweanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naweeda ghayi eadu, gaygabiikteawa naweedida, ak ea maygawa jeedeaba mujiineani gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gaydafur mujiineani ak ghaaghuuji aba badaydeanyu aniini. Ea aba badayda Dawdi was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
