        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eaweedida gawa malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda museasooda fuga Shaamu, ak ghabwar fih sagalamnyooji bughala ea seedam ea muut. Hean nea ghang'eat ng'eat buuneeda sakteayda nea gudea duw geadaah niiw muscheeka sean. ",
          "type": "text",
