              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda bwada aseeta aba gheeh Nisroki was aseataanyi. Geabwar aba ng'uta nea ghabwar Adrameleki ea Sharesa was orjoagaaschi, ak gamng'aw gaweay ng'eanyiida Ararati. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda Esar-hadoni was orjeedaanyi.",
